- [Show empty hands and talk](sentry_parley) ; check comms 9 else sentry_angry
- [Back off]()

### [Parley](sentry_parley)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% The weapon comes down. "The captain will talk. She will not like you. Go up the ramp."

- [Walk on]() ; calm sentry_1 sentry_2, lp flag parley

### [Wrong Answer](sentry_angry)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% The weapon comes all the way up.

- [Back off]() ; rouse sentry_1 sentry_2

### [Skaraan Deckhand](deckhand)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "Captain's on the bridge. Forward. Mind your hands."

- [Go forward]()

### [Vhesk](vhesk)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% The Skaraan captain does not stand. She has a Lantern-shaped scar of carving dust on her gauntlets. "You are the ship in orbit. You want my ship for their colony. So does everyone. Say what you are paying."

- [Answer in her own language](vhesk_listen) if skill comms >= 3
- [Make your case](vhesk_listen) ; check comms 10 else vhesk_scorn
- [Bring Yilla forward](vhesk_yilla) if holding yilla ; take yilla, signal lp_yilla_home
- [Leave]()

### [She Listens](vhesk_listen)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "The heart of that tower is worth more than their whole valley. It is in my vault. Passage for everyone - and the heart stays mine. That is the price."

- [Ask what she really wants](vhesk_truth) if skill comms >= 3
- [Accept: passage for the colony, she keeps the core](vhesk_deal_core)
- [Not yet]()

### [What She Lost](vhesk_truth)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% She is quiet long enough that her crew look round. "My brother's child went out on the flats four nights ago and did not come back. Somebody in that colony knows. Bring her home and you can have the heart and the ship both."

- [We will find her]() ; lp flag knows_yilla

### [A Deal](vhesk_deal_core)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "Tell them to walk up my ramp with one bag each."

- [Shake on it]() ; signal lp_bargain_core

### [Yilla Home](vhesk_yilla)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% Vhesk is out of her chair and across the deck before anybody sees her move. She holds the child a long moment, then looks at you over her head. "The vault is open to you. Take the heart. And tell your colony my ramp is down."

- [Take the vault key](vhesk_grateful) ; give vhesk_key, lp flag core_returned

### [Her Word](vhesk_grateful)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "Skaraan pay their debts."

- [Ask her to lift the colony now](vhesk_lift)
- [Not yet - we may not need the ship]()

### [The Ramp Is Down](vhesk_lift)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "Then send them."

- [Send them]() ; signal lp_bargain_good

### [Scorn](vhesk_scorn)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "Come back when you have something to say." Her crew laugh.

- [Leave]()

### [The Vault Crate](hold_crate)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% Under a tarp, packed in foam and cold to the touch: a faceted core the size of a person's chest, humming very faintly.

- [Take the Lantern core](hold_crate) if lp flag core_taken < 1 ; give lantern_core, lp flag core_taken
- [Leave it]()

### [Dr Castellan](castellan)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% The survey lead is propped against the cave wall, grey-faced, one leg wrapped in a jacket. "Glassback. It was not even trying." She looks at your packs. "Please tell me one of you is a doctor."

- [Treat the bite](castellan_saved) if holding antidote ; take antidote
- [Look at the wound](castellan_wound) if medical
- [What did you find down here?](castellan_found)
- [Hold on - we will be back]()

### [The Wound](castellan_wound)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% Neurotoxin, and not a fast one. A glassback's venom sac would give the clinic enough to make antivenom, if anyone can get one.

- [Hold on - we will be back]()

### [Saved](castellan_saved)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% The color comes back into her face over a long minute. "Thank you. Now listen - there is a way into the Lantern from down here, behind the crystal curtain at the north end. We felt the air move."

- [Get them both out]() ; signal lp_survivors_saved, discover lantern, dismiss castellan brandt

### [What She Found](castellan_found)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% "The glassbacks are coming up because the deep heat is going somewhere. Up. Toward the Lantern. It is waking, a little, every time the Skaraan dig at it."

- [Back]()

### [Oskar Brandt](brandt)
---
Speaker: stillwater
---
% A young technician with a cutting torch he is too scared to put down. "The glassbacks took the hauler coil, the one Harrow dropped when he ran from the Skaraan camp. Down past the vents. They sleep on anything warm."

- [Thanks]()

### [The Pedestal](pedestal)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
---
% An empty socket, faceted, exactly the shape of something that was taken.

- [Seat the Lantern core](pedestal) if holding lantern_core ; take lantern_core, lp flag core_seated, signal lp_core_seated
