### [The Control](control)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
---
% A console of shapes rather than keys. It is warm under your hand, and it is waiting for something.

- [Call the ship for power](control) if lp flag core_seated ; signal lp_power_ready
- [The console is awake](control_live) if lp flag powered
- [Step back]()

### [The Lantern Asks](control_live)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
---
% Light runs up the walls and out through the roof. Every face of the Lantern is open, and it is asking - in pictures, the way the panels taught - which way to turn.

- [Name the valley, the deep places and the sun](control_attuned) if lp glyph >= 4
- [Point it at the sun and let it go](control_woken)
- [Not yet]()

### [Attuned](control_attuned)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
---
% It turns slowly, precisely, and the shadow it throws falls over Stillwater like a hand over a candle. Far below, the caves cool.

- [Watch the shadow fall]() ; signal lp_wake_true

### [Woken](control_woken)
---
Speaker: lantern_voice
---
% It turns hard and fast. The valley goes dark. Under your feet the whole ridge shudders as the deep heat goes somewhere it was never meant to.

- [Hold on]() ; signal lp_wake_false
